      "html": "<b>October payrolls</b> \u2014 consensus about +65,000, unemployment 4.2%",
      "when": "Fri \u00b7 2026-11-06",
      "kind": "calendar"
     },
     {
      "tone": "c-fomc",
      "tag": "FOMC",
      "html": "<b>December Fed meeting</b> \u2014 a hike priced at about two-thirds",
      "when": "Tue\u2013Wed \u00b7 2026-12-08",
      "kind": "calendar"
     }
    ],
    "note": "<b>Friday brings October payrolls</b>, with a consensus of about 65,000 and unemployment at 4.2%. After the close <b>Cloudflare</b> and <b>Airbnb</b> rose on beats, while <b>DraftKings</b>, <b>Atlassian</b> and <b>Axon</b> fell more than 10%. The Fed meets on <b>8-9 December</b>."
   }
  ],
